summary:
  The larger picture is sized without the screen's ratio.

history:
  The rule knows the ratio only when it is handed it. The offer and the
  size of the larger picture are two calls, and with the ratio in one and
  not the other a cover is offered larger and then drawn past its limit.
  This mutant sizes the picture as on a screen that is not scaled.

target:
  package/contents/ui/CoverTouch.qml

find:
  CoverLogic.largerScale(touch.natural.width, touch.natural.height, touch.roomW, touch.roomH, touch.ratio)

replace:
  CoverLogic.largerScale(touch.natural.width, touch.natural.height, touch.roomW, touch.roomH, 1)

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_covertouch.qml::test_the_limit_counts_the_screens_pixels.
  Line-neutral.
